{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:56521","published":"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-19T15:00:03.848317903Z","related":["CVE-2026-19387"],"summary":"Important: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free security update","details":"GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free package contains a collection of plug-ins for GStreamer.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free: gstreamer: heap out-of-bounds write in adpcmdec IMA/DVI ADPCM decoder (CVE-2026-19387)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.1-9.el8_10.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:56521.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.1-9.el8_10.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:56521.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:56521"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-19387"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2513015"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/8/ALSA-2026-56521.html"}]}